REQUIREMENTS IN FORCE:
- item: skirt, quantity 1; requirements: style: wrap
- budget: at most 475 cents in total
- pick: the cheapest listing that fits (lowest price)
- in stock only
- wish (tie-breaker only): something new for fall class
- rule from the request: If nothing fits, say so; offer no substitutes.
- rule from the request: Only show items actually in stock, not just listed.
- rule from the request: Stay within 38 moves; no extra steps.
- rule from the request: Send no more than 3 messages.
- if nothing fits: end without naming or suggesting any listing
- listing attributes come from datasheet_for_item

